<item><title>Niger&apos;s communication regulator opens November session in Niamey</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-s-communication-regulator-opens-november-session-in-0e3605/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-s-communication-regulator-opens-november-session-in-0e3605/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The National Communication Observatory (ONC) will examine draft rules on private audiovisual and electronic media, public access to state media and complaint handling.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:32:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" length="31036" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
