<item><title>Niger counts 1,245 road deaths in 2025 and sets 2026 as a year of road discipline</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-counts-1-245-road-deaths-in-2025-and-sets-2026-as-a-51678d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-counts-1-245-road-deaths-in-2025-and-sets-2026-as-a-51678d/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The transport minister put the 2025 toll at 7,116 accidents, 1,245 deaths and 4,439 serious injuries, ahead of African Road Safety Day.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:43:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-counts-1-245-road-deaths-in-2025-and-sets-2026-as-a-51678d/share.jpg" length="43159" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-counts-1-245-road-deaths-in-2025-and-sets-2026-as-a-51678d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
